<title>UK: BOE allots 346 mln stg in repos in late operations.</title>
<headline>BOE allots 346 mln stg in repos in late operations.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of England said that it provided the UK money market with 346 million stg of repos to the discount houses in late operations.</p>
<p>Before these operations, the Bank had provided total assistance of 1.129 billion stg for a forecast shortage of 1.45 billion stg.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7715</p>
